    "term.svg" : {
      "comment" : "What the word svg means, in the glossary and the help of the screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "An SVG picture. Its body (body) is SVG; on a diagram the card draws it as an image fitted in its box (keeping its proportions), so scripts in it do not run and nothing outside is loaded. The body must read as XML with an svg root element. Placed in document, free and UI sections, and can be resized. When exported, one card is one file (.svg)"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "SVG の絵。本文（body）に SVG を書き、図の上ではカードの箱に収めて（縦横の比を保って）画像として描く（中のスクリプトは動かず、外のものは読み込まない）。本文は XML として読め、根が svg の要素であること。ドキュメント・フリー・UI のセクションに置き、大きさを変えられる。エクスポートすると 1 枚が 1 ファイル（.svg）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "term.symbol" : {
      "comment" : "What the word symbol means, in the glossary and the help of the screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Functions and types. A function, method, type, module, constant or macro inside a working directory's file of a language whose functions and types are read: a card the core makes from the file each time it reads it, with the bundled tree-sitter grammars (never kept). Its path goes on from the file's (repo/src:'a.rs'.Order.total; when one parent has the same name twice, the later ones get \" (2)\"). It has of (the same kinds in every language; the app marks them ƒ for a function or method, T a type, M a module, C a constant, # a macro), word (what its language calls it: fn, struct, protocol and so on) and language. Cards in main and branches point at it with the implementedBy line, and no line leaves it. card_read reads its declaration line (declaration), its body (body) and the names it calls (calls)"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "関数と型。関数と型を拾う言語の作業ディレクトリのファイルの中の関数・メソッド・型・モジュール・定数・マクロで、コアが同梱の tree-sitter の文法で読むたびにファイルから作るカード（保存しない）。パスはファイルのパスに続ける（repo/src:'a.rs'.Order.total。同じ親に同じ名前が並べば、あとのものに「 (2)」）。of（どの言語でも同じ分け方。画面の札は ƒ が関数とメソッド・T が型・M がモジュール・C が定数・# がマクロ）・word（その言語での呼び方: fn・struct・protocol など）・language を持つ。main と branch のカードから実装の線（implementedBy）で指せ、関数と型から線は出せない。card_read で宣言の 1 行（declaration）・中身（body）・呼んでいる名前（calls）を読む"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "term.table" : {
      "comment" : "What the word table means, in the glossary and the help of the screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A table. A table card that gathers the data (instance) of a shape (entity or value) by rules (within, where, columns, sort, unnest). It is placed in Definition, Document and Free sections. The shape is the of line (in MCP, the shape's path in the value key of). The diagram is a picture of the assembled table; in a document it goes in as a table through an embed in the body or a card row, and in an export it is a Markdown table"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "表。形（entity・value）のデータ（instance）を決まり（within・where・columns・sort・unnest）で集めた表のカード。定義・ドキュメント・フリーのセクションに置く。形は線 shapeOf（MCP は value のキー of に形のパス）。図は組み上がった表の絵で、文書には本文の埋め込みか行 card で表として入り、エクスポートでは Markdown の表"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "term.task" : {
      "comment" : "What the word task means, in the glossary and the help of the screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A task. It has a done check (done), a body (body: what was decided, how far it has gone, and the background), and Linked lines (line: link in connections). When put inside a goal, it appears as a row of the goal (number, check, name). On a diagram it is drawn as the face of the kind definition says, with the check and the Markdown of the body, and its size can be changed"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "タスク。済みのチェック（done）と、本文（body。決めたこと・どこまで進んだか・経緯）と、つながる線（connections の line: link）を持つ。goal の中に入れると、goal の行（番号・チェック・名前）として出る。図の上では種類の定義の face のとおり、チェックと本文の Markdown で描き、大きさを変えられる"
          }
        }
      }
    },
