        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A UI section. Lay out a screen with parts (html and svg cards) and frames (frame) that put other UI sections in. Notes can go here too. Sections made inside it are ui too. Added to a project with type: ui in its project_tree. In the app it opens on its section map, which draws the parts as the mock does, where they are placed and stacked in the section's order. A tag (headerPlace) and a sticky note (notePlace) are laid over each part's corners, shown or hidden with \"Headers\" and \"Notes\" on the diagram's top bar"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "UI のセクション。部品（html・svg のカード）と、ほかの UI のセクションをはめ込むはめ込み（frame）を置いて画面を組む。note も置ける。中に作るセクションも ui。プロジェクトの project_tree に type: ui で足す。画面ではセクションマップで開き、部品をモックと同じ見た目で、置いた所に並び順に重ねて描く。部品の角に見出しの札（headerPlace）と付箋（notePlace）を重ね、図の上のバーの「見出し」「ノート」で出し入れする"
          }
        }
      }
